This repository keeps a code wiki in `{{WIKI}}/`. At the start of a session, run
`sh {{WIKI}}/.wikipoke-hook.sh` and act on what it prints: it says when the wiki is behind the code,
and prints nothing when it is current. It never runs a model.

To update the wiki, follow `.agents/skills/wikipoke-ingest/SKILL.md`; to answer a question from
it, `.agents/skills/wikipoke-query/SKILL.md`.
